# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Valentín Vassilev-Galindo et al. (2021). Challenges for machine learning force fields in reproducing potential energy surfaces of flexible molecules.
#   The Journal of Chemical Physics. doi:10.1063/5.0038516  arXiv:2103.01103v1
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2103.01103v1 (sha256 9a87903134778131...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
