# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/vassilevgalindo2021.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: BPNN, SchNet, GAP/SOAP and sGDML models (5 A cutoff
# for the local models) trained with 5-fold cross-validation on
# Boltzmann-selected subsets of PBE+TS datasets for glycine and for the
# azobenzene inversion and rotation isomerization paths, and the one
# exact error stated in the text (best SchNet with 1,000 rotation points
# over the whole rotation dataset). Learning curves are figure-only; an
# extended sGDML descriptor is a setting.

